cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the audit scripts or the stamped artifacts in this repository,
  please cite them using the metadata below.
title: >-
  Terrain Models Under Tall Amazon Canopy: Label and Reference Error
  Outweighs the Choice of Estimator — audit scripts and stamped artifacts
abstract: >-
  Audit scripts and stamped JSON artifacts supporting the manuscript "Terrain
  Models Under Tall Amazon Canopy: Label and Reference Error Outweighs the
  Choice of Estimator" (IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied Earth
  Observations and Remote Sensing). Every number quoted in the manuscript has
  a line in the fact sheet (audit/folha_de_fatos_jstars_v27.py and its output
  audit/folha_de_fatos_jstars_v27.json) pointing to a stamped artifact and
  field; a number without a line does not exist.
type: software
